# Cormorant Skerry - a new small island of the library (ROADMAP 3d NI3), no quest
# A cold little skerry in the north: snow in the hollows, a few pines, berry bushes, and the cormorants' nests on its
# rocks. On the shore somebody hauled up a little boat and turned it over to keep it from the snow - beside it a fire
# ring and a crate of what they had. Nothing hostile.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe cormorant_skerry) through the editor's own operations. Points: the boat shelter's
# pad (2 m, r 4.5 round 5 -9), the upturned boat at 6 -8, the crate beside it at 6 -5.8, the fire ring at 3.5 -10; the nests
# on the rocks round -4 5 (the top, 5.5 m).
include lib_huts
include lib_sea
include lib_features
include lib_ni34
new
# (nature: a snowy skerry - few trees, more rocks, berries for harvest)
gen Trees=0.12 Bushes=0.25 Rocks=0.5 Harvest=0.2 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=7409 Radius=24 Height=6 Roughness=0.45 Peaks=1 Shape=0 Style=1 BeachWidth=0.4 Cliffs=0.4 PeakShape=0.5
gen SeaFloor=0 Shelf=0.5 Seabed=2
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.45 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.4 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0
generate

# ===== Terrain: the boat shelter's pad on the south shore, the rocky top ===================================================
brush flatten at 5 -9 r=4.5 s=20 frames=60 h=2
brush flatten at -4 5 r=3.5 s=20 frames=60 h=5.5
brush rock at -4 5 r=6 s=20 frames=20
clear at 5 -9 r=5.5
clear at -4 5 r=4.5

# ===== The upturned boat, the crate beside it, the fire ring; firewood ==========================================
place RT_PlasticBoat shelterboat at 6 -8 ground sit centred roll=180 yaw=70
place Loot_Crate sheltercrate at 6 -5.8 ground sit yaw=20
place campfire_1 - at 3.5 -10.5 ground sit
place Firewood_1 - at 2.4 -8.6 ground sit yaw=40

# ===== The cormorants' nests on the top; snow drifts, pines and berries ===================================================
place Bird_Nest - at -4.5 4 ground sit
place Bird_Nest - at -2.6 6.2 ground sit yaw=90
place Placeable_BirdsNest - at -3.6 5.6 ground sit yaw=200
place TP_SnowDrift01 - at -10 -2 ground sit yaw=30
place TP_SnowDrift02 - at 9 6 ground sit yaw=150
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Pine" 2 at 0 0 r=18 seed=7419 free=6
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_BerryBush" 3 at 0 0 r=18 seed=7429 free=3
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=14 n=1 seed=7409
call shallows r=40 deep=5 n=1 seed=749

info title=Cormorant Skerry
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A cold little skerry where the cormorants nest - snow in the hollows, a few pines, and on the shore a little boat hauled up and turned over, a fire ring and a crate beside it. No quest - an island to explore.

note sheltercrate Crate by the boat | Lashed shut against the weather: wool, a tin of meat, rope, a few nails.
loot sheltercrate Wool*3;Cooked_GenericMeat*1;Rope*2;Nail*6
prop sheltercrate loot.refill=0

save Cormorant Skerry
